  "details": "No offense, but the recent update to the user profile is kind of awful.\nSo I'll put my money where my mouth is, and mock up a User profile I find more agreeable. It's kind of a mix between the old one and new one I think.\nMy main points of contention are the current world being the same size as published worlds, and the reduced size of the avatar preview, as well as some general button placement.\nI for one, liked that before, clicking a user's profile netted you a larger avatar preview.\nCurrent world size issue is self explanatory, and I don't know what your UI people were thinking with that.\nButton placement was shuffled a bit to hopefully feel more organic. \nI know people complained about the placement of the Join/invite buttons, but really only because you placed the report/moderate button *exactly* where they were. this should eliminate that issue by simply not having any buttons in that region.\nOverall, this isn't entirely an Ideal UI, but it's taking what you have right now and trying to make it feel a bit better.",
